<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="description" content="{{DESCRIPTION}}"><title>{{TITLE}} · AI2AI Duplex</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="../assets/site.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../assets/trajectory/viewer.css"><script defer src="../assets/trajectory/viewer.js"></script></head>
<body><a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to experiment</a><header class="site-nav"><div class="nav-inner"><a class="brand" href="../index.html">AI2AI Duplex</a>{{NAV}}</div></header>
<main id="main"><div class="container"><header class="hero viewer-hero"><p class="eyebrow">Current controlled study · 8 October 2026</p><h1>{{TITLE}}</h1><p class="lede">{{DESCRIPTION}}</p><p class="meta"><a href="index.html">All experiments</a> · <a href="controlled-study.html">Study status and criteria</a> · {{OTHER_EXPERIMENT}} · <a href="archive.html">Historical archive</a></p></header>
{{EXAMPLE_INTRO}}
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="load-title"><h2 id="load-title">Choose the condition</h2><div class="load-panel" id="drop-zone"><label for="interactive-case">Condition <select id="interactive-case"></select></label><label class="button" for="trace-file">Import local trace<input id="trace-file" type="file" accept=".json,application/json"></label><a class="button" href="{{DATA_URL}}" download>Download this experiment</a><span>Or drop a JSON trace here.</span></div><p id="load-status" role="status" class="meta">Loading current condition…</p><div class="callout" id="evidence-note"></div></section>
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="audio-title"><h2 id="audio-title">Listen to the selected condition</h2><p id="audition-scope" class="section-intro"></p><div class="audio-panel"><label for="clip-select">Clip <select id="clip-select"></select></label><audio id="clip-player" controls preload="metadata"></audio><p id="clip-note" class="meta"></p><figure class="waveform-figure"><svg id="waveform" role="img" aria-labelledby="wave-title" viewBox="0 0 800 90"><title id="wave-title">Selected clip waveform</title></svg><figcaption>Figure 1. Selected audio waveform. Input previews contain authored synthetic speech. Completed replays contain actual model playback; the envelope does not establish word alignment.</figcaption></figure></div><p class="meta">Authored prompts, synthesized on CPU with the Flite SLT voice. <a href="../research/flite/COPYING">Flite attribution and license</a> · <a href="../research/current-study.json">Source and run record</a>.</p></section>
<section id="timeline-section" class="section" aria-labelledby="timeline-title"><h2 id="timeline-title">Request and control timeline</h2><p id="clock-note" class="meta"></p><h3 id="run-title"></h3><div class="toolbar"><button id="play" type="button" class="button primary">Replay timing</button><button id="reset" type="button" class="button">Rewind</button><label>Speed <select id="speed"><option value="0.5">0.5×</option><option value="1" selected>1×</option><option value="2">2×</option><option value="5">5×</option><option value="10">10×</option></select></label><label><input type="checkbox" id="warmup"> Include startup</label><label>Zoom <input type="range" id="zoom" min="1" max="12" value="1" step="1"></label><output id="time-label">0.000 s</output></div><label class="scrub-label" for="scrub">Cursor <input id="scrub" type="range" min="0" max="10" value="0" step="0.001"></label><figure class="trajectory-figure"><div class="timeline-scroll" id="timeline-scroll"><svg id="timeline" role="img" aria-labelledby="svg-title svg-description"><title id="svg-title">Request and control events</title><desc id="svg-description">Input, S1, S2 and Talker events when the run has completed.</desc></svg></div><figcaption>Figure 2. Captured client events in the selected clock. Input previews have no invented model events. Measured spans show request timing and returned text; they do not measure GPU kernels or acoustic word boundaries.</figcaption></figure><div class="stat-grid" id="stats"></div><div class="inspector-grid"><article class="card"><h3>Selected event</h3><p id="selection-title">Click an event.</p><pre id="event-detail"></pre></article><article class="card"><h3>State at cursor</h3><p id="active-layers"></p><dl class="cursor-state"><dt>User transcription</dt><dd id="s1-asr"></dd><dt>S1 speech text</dt><dd id="s1-text"></dd><dt>S2 reasoning count</dt><dd id="reasoning-progress"></dd><dt>S2 answer text</dt><dd id="s2-text"></dd><dt>Guidance delivered to S1</dt><dd id="s2-delivered"></dd><dt>Latest control</dt><dd id="control-text"></dd></dl></article></div></section>
<section id="events-section" class="section" aria-labelledby="events-title"><h2 id="events-title">Event details</h2><div class="filter"><label for="event-search">Find events</label><input id="event-search" type="search" placeholder="Layer, text or control"><output id="event-count"></output></div><div class="table-wrap event-table"><table><caption>Table 1. Captured event boundaries. Request end means response received. An empty ledger means model event data is pending.</caption><thead><tr><th>Layer</th><th>Start (s)</th><th>End (s)</th><th>Event</th></tr></thead><tbody id="event-rows"></tbody></table></div><details><summary>Run metadata</summary><pre id="run-metadata"></pre></details><h3>Evidence limits</h3><ul id="limitations"></ul></section>
<footer class="site-footer"><p><a href="index.html">All experiments</a> · <a href="archive.html">Historical archive</a> · <a href="../index.html">Project home</a></p></footer></div></main><script id="recorded-example" type="application/json">{{EXAMPLE}}</script></body></html>
